1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,560
Shaxmat tarixidagi eng yosh jahon chempionati o‘yinida yana durang qayd etildi.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:08,670
Jenevada o‘zbekistonlik Javohir Sindarov jahon chempioni Gukeshga qarshi 3-partiyani oq donalar bilan o‘ynadi.

3
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:12,000
60 yurish davom etgan qattiq kurash yana durang bilan yakunlandi.

4
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:14,010
Hisob bir yarimga bir yarim.

5
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:18,150
Sindarovning reytingi 2782, u dunyo bo‘yicha 4-o‘rinda.

6
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,530
Magnus Karlsen uni favorit deb atagan.

7
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:23,050
Ammo Gukesh hozircha bosimga bardosh bermoqda.

8
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:25,100
Oldinda yana o‘n bitta partiya bor.

9
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:27,780
Yetti yarim ochko to‘plagan o‘yinchi jahon chempioni bo‘ladi.

10
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:30,590
Sizningcha, tarixiy g‘alaba kimga nasib etadi?

11
00:00:30,730 --> 00:00:32,260
Izohlarda yozing.

